61DMbM32Yxa_1L4qyW3LFTEUEcyhig&oe=6AD0D39D"}, {"file_name": "shot8.png", "id": "1078876354402150", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831792_1078876361068816_7320177253397831895_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EzTDIWwwULEQ7kNvwF8Afbk&_nc_oc=Adp0gRcC9_8A6ARrPd9sMhv7xKc9fW16HAjmSVg6uKccgOWC-yKnGRSlYXdl19JVW5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPRvtk7RlctuuLhL1vubItQ-0CtuyuTnQHB-bfnpKSsSg&oe=6AD101C3"}, {"file_name": "shot6.png", "id": "2125495244947060", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294601_2125495248280393_5327250173659505170_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l0vzPrhTfgEQ7kNvwF4YCQg&_nc_oc=AdrB4sUKNEkEzxzJ0QlkZ5ZoYNfF-Ff1tUqvMxt_N4ikGG6VpkKyFvCXOOF4wTWMSKk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMcSMw7XbyPBe6DGZotHOBUVW2f06-FMd2lSx_PkTMpdA&oe=6AD0E9D6"}, {"file_name": "shot5.png", "id": "4199188353636788", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_4199188356970121_7527469587437860735_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M-_2tLbGoVUQ7kNvwHTMdIV&_nc_oc=Adp9-xlWjjuhKrQmGJ9oMtT8nJZLH_QaQ-rXE1G5YoMc29p7vbI7kZKCgudjgNScsPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNHQmte_nnoK0J9AYOk-Ters_uNryOI_v0mwAUX5MVsOQ&oe=6AD0F99C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Highmark SSH", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## A Real SSH Terminal for Meta Quest\n\nHighmark SSH is a native SSH terminal emulator built for Meta Quest. Connect to your Linux servers, cloud instances, or home lab \u2014 right from your headset.\n\n### Why Highmark SSH?\n\n- **Full terminal emulation** \u2014 VT-100 compatible, powered by the Termux terminal engine. Run htop, vim, tmux, and everything else you'd expect.\n- **Multi-tab sessions** \u2014 Open multiple SSH connections simultaneously and switch between them instantly.\n- **Secure by default** \u2014 Passwords encrypted with AES-256-GCM via hardware-backed Android Keystore. Host key verification with Trust-on-First-Use (TOFU) and MITM warnings.\n- **Works your way** \u2014 Use Quest controllers with the virtual keyboard, or plug in a physical Bluetooth keyboard for a full typing experience.\n- **Quick connect** \u2014 Paste `user@host:port` to auto-fill. Save favorites for one-tap reconnection.\n\n### Privacy First\n\nNo accounts. No analytics. No telemetry. No third-party servers. Highmark SSH connects directly to your SSH hosts and nothing else. All data stays on your device.\n\n### Open Source\n\nHighmark SSH is open source under MIT/GPL v3. View the code, report issues, or contribute at github.com/rabbitHoleSolutions/highmark-ssh.\n\n### Supported Devices\n\nQuest 2, Quest Pro, Quest 3, Quest 3S\n", "short_description": "Highmark SSH brings a full-featured SSH terminal to your Meta Quest headset. Connect to remote servers, run commands, and manage systems \u2014 all from VR. Features multi-tab sessions, encrypted password storage (AES-256-GCM), connection history with favorites, and Trust-on-First-Use host key verification. Works with Quest controllers or a physical keyboard. No accounts, no tracking, no telemetry \u2014 just a fast, secure terminal that connects directly to your servers. Open source on GitHub.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/rabbitHoleSolutions/highmark-ssh/blob/main/PRIVACY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://github.com/rabbitHoleSolutions/highmark-ssh/blob/main/TERMS.md", "publisher_name": "Rabbit Hole Solutions Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://rabbitholesolutions.ca/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1055187466124150"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres